# studio.style — the app's DARK PALETTE.
#
# Split from the proportions (studio.common.style) so the light theme can have the studio's own
# control heights, tab behaviour and radii without also inheriting its dark surfaces. This file is
# applied for the Dark theme only; Light starts from the framework's light palette instead.
# The brand accent is NOT here — it belongs to the app in either theme, so it lives in the common
# sheet and an orange studio stays an orange studio with the lights on.
surface0:      18 18 20
surface1:      28 28 30
surface2:      40 40 42
surface3:      56 56 58
border:        72 72 76
textPrimary:   240 240 245
textSecondary: 160 160 168
